RecoverKit third-party notices
==============================

RecoverKit's installer contains only RecoverKit itself (and, in the self-contained build, the
.NET runtime, MIT License, https://github.com/dotnet/runtime). The components below are not
bundled: RecoverKit downloads them from their official sources on first use, checks their
SHA-256, and stores them in the user's profile. Each remains under its own license.

